```

***
```java
// Good example: Uses parameterized query to prevent SQL injection
String userInput = request.getParameter("username"); // User-controlled input
// Secure: Parameterized API ensures input is properly sanitized
PreparedStatement pstmt = connection.prepareStatement("SELECT * FROM users WHERE username = ?");
pstmt.setString(1, userInput); // Input is safely bound to the query parameter
ResultSet rs = pstmt.executeQuery();
```

